  "Google Play installed this copy, so Google Play updates it — usually on its own, in the background. Open the listing to do it now.": "Le khophi ifakwe yi-Google Play, ngakho yi-Google Play eyibuyekezayo — imvamisa iyazenzela, ngemuva. Vula ikhasi lohlelo lokusebenza uma ufuna ukukwenza manje.",
