  "Hit Download on a movie or an episode, or paste a magnet.": "Cindezela u-Landa efilimini noma esiqeshini, noma unamathisele i-magnet.",
  "Holds the whole film near one volume. A whispered line and the explosion after it end up much closer together.": "Kugcina ifilimu yonke iseduze nezinga elilodwa lomsindo. Umugqa okhulunywe ngokunyenyeza nokuqhuma okulandelayo kusondelana kakhulu.",
  "Home": "Ikhaya",
  "How big the interface and the posters on the browse pages are.": "Ubukhulu besixhumi neziqwembe emakhasini okuphequlula.",
  "How much of a streamed film is kept on the device around what is playing. More ahead rides out a swarm that slows down; more behind is a rewind that doesn't have to be fetched again. Both are cut down to fit when the device is short of space.": "Ukuthi ingakanani yefilimu esakazwayo egcinwa kudivayisi eduze kwalokho okudlalayo. Okuningi phambili kubekezelela iswamu elehlayo; okuningi emuva kuwukubuyisela emuva okungadingi ukulandwa futhi. Kokubili kuyancishiswa uma idivayisi ingenaso isikhala esanele.",
  "IPTV, M3U, M3U8, Xtream Codes, channels, television, playlist": "IPTV, M3U, M3U8, Xtream Codes, iziteshi, ithelevishini, TV, uhlu lokudlala",
  "Improve performance": "Thuthukisa ukusebenza",
  "In cinemas": "Kumabhayisikobho",
  "In downloads": "Kokulandiwe",
  "In the screen that just opened, choose the drive, then “Erase & format as removable storage”. Come back here afterwards and it will be in the list.": "Esikrinini esisanda kuvuleka, khetha idrayivu, bese ukhetha okuthi “Sula futhi ufomethe njengesitoreji esisusekayo”. Buyela lapha emva kwalokho futhi izobe isohlwini.",
  "In this file": "Kuleli fayela",
  "In this release": "Kuleli reliza",
  "Installed. It takes effect the next time Ventic starts.": "Ifakiwe. Iqala ukusebenza ngesikhathi esilandelayo u-Ventic eqala.",
  "It tells most while moving around with a remote, which is where the fades stack up: on the television this was measured on, that went from 3 frames a second to 23. It starts on there, and off everywhere else.": "Kubonakala kakhulu uma unyakaza ngerimothi, yilapho okuhwamalala kunqwabelana khona: kuthelevishini lapha lokhu kwakalwa khona, kwenyuka kusuka kumafreyimu angu-3 ngomzuzwana kwaya kwangu-23. Lapho kuqala kuvuliwe, kwenye yonke indawo kucimile.",
  "It was the fall that killed him.\nNot the drop — the sudden stop.": "Yikuwa okwambulala.\nHhayi ukuphonseka — kodwa ukuma kungazelelwe.",
  "Its channels will appear under Live TV. A playlist link usually carries your account details, so it is kept out of backups.": "Iziteshi zalo zizovela ngaphansi kwe-TV Ebukhoma. Isixhumanisi sohlu lokudlala ngokuvamile siqukethe imininingwane ye-akhawunti yakho, ngakho sigcinwa ngaphandle kwezipele.",
  "Its channels will appear under Live TV. The password is stored with the address and kept out of backups.": "Iziteshi zalo zizovela ngaphansi kwe-TV Ebukhoma. Iphasiwedi igcinwa kanye nekheli futhi ihlala ngaphandle kwezipele.",
  "Jump to the end": "Yeqela ekugcineni",
