  "Keep what you have watched in step across every screen you use Ventic on. There is no Ventic account and no server of ours in the middle: the app keeps one small file in storage you already have, and every device reads and writes that same file.": "Gcina lokho okubukile kuvumelana kuzo zonke iziskrini osebenzisa i-Ventic kuzo. Alikho i-akhawunti ye-Ventic futhi ayikho iseva yethu emaphakathi: uhlelo lugcina ifayela elilodwa elincane esitoreji osuvele unaso, futhi yonke idivayisi ifunda ibhale lelo fayela elifanayo.",
