  "Money is the least of it. Reporting a bug with what you did before it happened, translating the app into a language you actually speak, or telling somebody it exists are all worth more than a coffee.": "Imali yiyona into encane kunazo zonke. Ukubika iphutha uchaze nokuthi ubenzani ngaphambi kokuba lenzeke, ukuhumusha uhlelo lokusebenza ngolimi olukhulunywa nguwe ngempela, noma ukutshela othile ukuthi lukhona — konke lokhu kubaluleke ngaphezu kwekhofi.",
