  "Most servers let you make a password that only works for one app — use one of those here rather than the password to your whole account. It is stored on this device and is the one thing a backup file never carries.": "Iningi lamaseva likuvumela wenze iphasiwedi esebenza kuhlelo olulodwa kuphela — sebenzisa enjalo lapha esikhundleni sephasiwedi ye-akhawunti yakho yonke. Igcinwa kule divayisi futhi iyona kuphela into ifayela lokugcina elingakaze liyithathe.",
