  "No overview.": "Asikho isifinyezo.",
  "No peer answered with this release's details, so there is nothing to play yet. Try a different one.": "Alikho i-peer eliphendule ngemininingwane yaleli reliza, ngakho ayikho into engadlalwa okwamanje. Zama elinye.",
  "No playlists yet. Live TV stays empty until you add one — the app comes with no channels and suggests none.": "Azikho izinhlu zokudlala okwamanje. I-TV Ebukhoma izohlala ingenalutho uze wengeze olulodwa — uhlelo aluzi nasiteshi futhi alusiphakamisi.",
  "No sound — this device can't decode this release's audio (Dolby or DTS). A release with AAC audio will play.": "Awukho umsindo — le divayisi ayikwazi ukuhumusha umsindo waleli reliza (i-Dolby noma i-DTS). Ireliza elinomsindo we-AAC lizodlala.",
  "No source answered — {reason}": "Awukho umthombo ophendulile — {reason}",
  "No sources configured. Add one in Settings → Sources.": "Ayikho imithombo elungiselelwe. Engeza omunye ku-Izilungiselelo → Imithombo.",
  "No sources yet. Until you add one, the app plays what you already have — anything in Downloads, and any magnet or torrent file you open yourself.": "Ayikho imithombo okwamanje. Kuze kube ungeza owodwa, uhlelo lokusebenza ludlala lokho osunakho — noma yini ekokulandiwe, nanoma yiliphi i-magnet noma ifayela lethorenti oliyivula wena.",
  "No storage settings on this device. Format the drive as FAT32 on a computer — every Android box accepts it.": "Azikho izilungiselelo zesitoreji kule divayisi. Fometha idrayivu ibe yi-FAT32 kukhompyutha — wonke amabhokisi e-Android ayayamukela.",
  "No subtitles found.": "Ayitholakalanga imibhalo engezansi.",
  "No title or IMDb id for this stream, so nothing to search by.": "Lesi sakazo asinaso isihloko noma i-IDi ye-IMDb, ngakho akukho okungaseshwa ngakho.",
  "No torrents match this filter.": "Awekho amathorenti ahambisana nalesi sihlungi.",
  "None": "Lutho",
  "Normal": "Okujwayelekile",
  "Normal speed": "Isivinini esijwayelekile",
  "Not enough has played yet — auto-sync needs about {minutes} minutes of audio to be sure. Nudge the delay for now.": "Akukadlalwa okwanele — ukuvumelanisa okuzenzakalelayo kudinga cishe imizuzu engu-{minutes} yomsindo ukuze kuqiniseke. Okwamanje lungisa ukulibaziseka ngesandla.",
  "Not now": "Hhayi manje",
  "Not set": "Akusethiwe",
  "Not synced yet. Press Sync now, or wait — Ventic syncs on its own every few minutes and whenever a film ends.": "Akukavumelaniswa okwamanje. Cindezela u-Vumelanisa manje, noma ulinde — i-Ventic izivumelanisa ngokwayo njalo emizuzwini embalwa nanoma nini lapho ifilimu iphela.",
  "Nothing answered. On the other device, switch on Settings → Network → “Let other devices play films on this one”, then search again — or type its address below.": "Akukho okuphendulile. Kwenye idivayisi, vula Izilungiselelo → Inethiwekhi → “Vumela amanye amadivayisi adlale amafilimu kule”, bese uphinde usesha — noma uthayiphe ikheli layo ngezansi.",
  "Nothing arrived from the swarm. This release has no seeders that will talk to this device — try a different one.": "Akukho okufikile emhlambini. Lokhu okukhishiwe akunawo ama-seeder azokhuluma nale divayisi — zama okunye.",
  "Nothing certain in the last twenty minutes — listening to the whole film…": "Akukho okuqinisekile emizuzwini engamashumi amabili edlule — ilalela ifilimu lonke…",
  "Nothing chosen yet, so the background is a flat colour for now.": "Akukho okukhethiwe okwamanje, ngakho isizinda okwamanje ngumbala ovamile.",
  "Nothing downloading.": "Akukho okulandwayo.",
  "Nothing here.": "Akukho lutho lapha.",
  "Nothing is arriving on the device this was cast from — its release has no seeders that will talk to it. Pick a different one over there.": "Akukho okufika kudivayisi obekusakazwa kuyo — ireliza layo alinawo ama-seeder azokhuluma nayo. Khetha elinye lapho.",
  "Nothing matches.": "Akukho okuhambisanayo.",
  "Nothing on this device can open that file. HEVC/x265 and AV1 depend on the hardware decoder, and older boxes have neither — try a 1080p x264 release.": "Akukho lutho kule divayisi olungavula lelo fayela. I-HEVC/x265 ne-AV1 zincike kudikhoda yehadiwe, futhi amabhokisi amadala awanayo neyodwa — zama ireliza le-1080p x264.",
  "Nothing to play": "Akukho okungadlalwa",
  "Off": "Kucimile",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Uma kucimile, isizinda sakho asifakwa kulokhu: itimu igcina imibala yayo ngenkathi isithombe sibonakala, futhi ishintsha kuphela uma izithombe zesihloko zisimboza.",
  "On the air": "Kusakazwa manje",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Uma kuvuliwe, isizinda silandela ikhadi olikhombayo noma olikhethile. Uma kucimile, sishintsha kuphela uma uvula okuthile ngempela — kuzinzile kakhudlwana ohlwini olude, lapho ukudlula emgqeni kungadweba kabusha lonke iwindi ikhadi ngekhadi.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Uma kuvuliwe, uhlelo lokusebenza lume phezu kwesithombe sakho futhi izithombe zisimboza uma usefilimini noma ohlelweni. Uma kucimile, isithombe sihlala lapho sikhona futhi asikaze simbozwe.",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "Umbala owodwa, bese ijeneretha ye-Material ibala okusele kohlaka lwemibala isuka kuwo.",
  "One earlier episode in this season is still unwatched.": "Sikhona isiqephu esisodwa esandulele kulesi sizini esingakabukwa.",
  "One earlier season is still unwatched.": "Sikhona isizini esisodwa esandulele esingakabukwa.",
  "One-off or monthly, from any card or PayPal. Ko-fi takes no cut of it.": "Kanye nje noma inyanga ngayinye, nganoma yiliphi ikhadi noma nge-PayPal. I-Ko-fi ayithathi lutho kukho.",
  "Only download on Wi-Fi": "Landa kuphela nge-Wi-Fi",
  "Only downloaded subtitles can be synced; the file's own tracks already match it.": "Yimibhalo engezansi elandiwe kuphela engavumelaniswa; amathrekhi efayela uqobo asevele ahambisana nalo.",
  "Only needed if the app stops loading artwork and titles. Create one free under your TMDB account settings, API, “API Read Access Token”. It is kept out of backup files.": "Kudingeka kuphela uma uhlelo lokusebenza luyeka ukulayisha izithombe nezihloko. Yakha eyodwa mahhala kuzilungiselelo ze-akhawunti yakho ye-TMDB, ku-API, ku-“API Read Access Token”. Ayifakwa kumafayela esipele.",
