  "Pick the one your VPN creates — usually named tun, wg or utun, with the address your VPN gave you. Only torrent traffic is tied to it: searching sources, film details and subtitles use the normal connection.": "Khetha leyo edalwa i-VPN yakho — ngokuvamile ibizwa ngokuthi tun, wg noma utun, inekheli oyinikwe yi-VPN yakho. Kuboshelwa kuyo kuphela ithrafikhi ye-torrent: ukusesha imithombo, imininingwane yama-movie kanye nemibhalo engezansi kusebenzisa ukuxhumeka okuvamile.",
