  "Retry download": "Zama ukulanda futhi",
  "Revenue": "Imali engenile",
  "Reverse": "Guqula uhlelo",
  "Rides the volume for you, so the quiet lines come up and the loud scenes stop making you reach for the remote. This is what every film starts with — the player's own Audio panel changes the film you are watching and nothing else.": "Kuqondisa umsindo esikhundleni sakho, ukuze imigqa ethulile iphakame futhi izigcawu ezizwakalayo zingasakuphoqi ukuthi uthathe irimothi. Yilokhu wonke amafilimu aqala ngakho — iphaneli Yomsindo yesidlali uqobo iguqula kuphela ifilimu oyibukayo.",
  "Right now": "Njengamanje",
  "Room for {size} of films here. A film that fits is downloaded whole, making space by deleting what was watched longest ago; one that won't fit even then streams instead.": "Kunesikhala samafilimu angu-{size} lapha. Ifilimu engenayo ilandwa iphelele, yenze isikhala ngokususa okubukwe kudala kakhulu; engangeni ngisho nangaleso sikhathi isakazwa esikhundleni salokho.",
  "Roughly what a 720p frame looks like. Changes reach a running player straight away.": "Cishe kubukeka njengefreyimu le-720p. Izinguquko zifika ngokushesha kumdlali osebenzayo.",
  "Run this, then try again:": "Sebenzisa lokhu, bese uzama futhi:",
