  "Shown on the other device, under Settings → Network. Leave it empty if that device doesn't ask for one.": "Iboniswa kwenye idivayisi, ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo → Inethiwekhi. Yishiye ingenalutho uma leyo divayisi ingaceli lutho.",
  "Size": "Usayizi",
  "Sizes in amber cost more bandwidth than the picture is worth.": "Osayizi abamibalabala esikhunta badla i-bandwidth eyeqile kunaleyo isithombe esiyifanele.",
  "Sizes in red are over the {limit} file limit of the download drive — those stream instead of downloading.": "Osayizi ababomvu badlula umkhawulo wefayela we-{limit} wedrayivu yokulanda — lawo asakazwa esikhundleni sokulandwa.",
