  "Where downloads go": "Lapho okulandiwe kuya khona",
  "Where films and episodes are written. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Lapho amafilimu neziqephu kubhalwa khona. Amathorenti asalandiwe ahlala lapho ekhona.",
  "Where to keep downloads": "Lapho okulandiwe kugcinwa khona",
  "Whether a film is downloaded whole and kept, or streamed through a small buffer that is deleted when you stop.": "Ukuthi ifilimu ilandwa iphelele futhi igcinwe, noma isakazwa ngebhafa encane esuswayo uma uyimisa.",
  "Which copy to reach for when Ventic picks one for you. It is a preference and not a filter: a tier with nothing worth streaming in it falls through to the next, so asking for 4K on a title that has none still plays the best 1080p.": "Ukuthi u-Ventic athathe iphi ikhophi lapho ekukhethela. Lokhu kuyintandokazi, hhayi isihlungi: izinga elingenalutho okufanele lisakazwe liyadlulela kwelilandelayo, ngakho ukucela i-4K esihlokweni esingenayo kusadlala i-1080p engcono kakhulu.",
  "Which drive films and episodes are written to — a plugged-in stick usually holds far more than the box itself. Uninstalling the app still removes them. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "Ukuthi amafilimu neziqephu kubhalwa kuyiphi idrayivu — usiphuli olufakiwe luvamise ukuthwala okuningi kakhulu kunebhokisi uqobo. Ukukhipha uhlelo lokusebenza kusakususa. Amathorenti asalandiwe ahlala lapho ekhona.",
  "While a film is playing. Choose one, then press the key you want it on — Backspace takes it away, Escape leaves it as it was.": "Ngesikhathi ifilimu idlala. Khetha okukodwa, bese ucindezela inkinobho oyifunayo — u-Backspace uyayisusa, u-Escape uyishiya njengoba ibinjalo.",
  "Windows can't tie torrents to one connection. Most VPN apps have a kill switch of their own that does the same job — turn that on.": "I-Windows ayikwazi ukubophela ama-torrent ekuxhumekeni okukodwa. Izinhlelo zokusebenza eziningi ze-VPN zine-kill switch yazo eyenza umsebenzi ofanayo — yivule.",
  "Without a code, anything on this network can play a film on this screen — fine at home, worth switching back on anywhere else.": "Ngaphandle kwekhodi, noma yini ekule nethiwekhi ingadlala ifilimu kulesi sikrini — kulungile ekhaya, kufanele uyivule futhi kwenye indawo.",
  "Worth turning on wherever the app feels heavy — a television or a set-top box most of all, where the graphics chip is a fraction of a laptop's.": "Kufanelekile ukukuvula nomaphi lapho uhlelo lokusebenza lubonakala lunzima — ikakhulukazi kuthelevishini noma kubhokisi le-set-top, lapho ishipi yamagrafikhi iyingxenye encane yaleyo yelaptop.",
